      "title": "Identifying a Triangular Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "58747ea7-d7b2-5aef-9d93-70ab49f2c267",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is a lower triangular matrix?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $A$ is a matrix for which all entries *above* the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nHence, it is a lower triangular matrix. \n\nBy contrast, matrices $B$, $C$, $D$, and $E$ each have at least one non-zero entry above the diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 10\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -11 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 11 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 7 & -10 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, they are not lower triangular matrices.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "94b40efc-0bef-5d5e-834e-de5d27e596f9",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "dc419dda-cd69-58e3-9481-fca9ceb6cbee",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "12e26330-87da-58ac-a433-fa2896180417",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "B=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 10\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "aded4e0b-0695-510f-af65-f24589f38af7",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "E=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 11 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 7 & -10 & -7\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "dca1198e-b78d-5105-96eb-45fbea6be8c4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "cca57c94-bd06-5b10-98cd-95f0433ff7e9",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "C=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -11 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}"
            }
          ],
